WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.620
Continue the same estimate guide, offer and revised sample.

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:11.805
Map the outer flow: discover, understand, choose, receive, begin, participate, support, complete and follow-up.

00:00:11.805 --> 00:00:18.991
Map the inner participation steps: enter, orient, engage, respond, review, support, complete and continue.

00:00:18.991 --> 00:00:26.177
Connect receipt to entry, beginning to orientation and participation to the attempt and review.

00:00:26.177 --> 00:00:30.284
Keep support and completion consistent in both maps.

00:00:30.284 --> 00:00:38.496
For each stage, record the person’s question, required information, possible AI support and accountable human owner.

00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:43.116
Internal delivery still needs clear service expectations and ownership.

00:00:43.116 --> 00:00:49.275
A paid flow also needs approved pricing and an appropriate payment route.

00:00:49.275 --> 00:00:52.868
Record unresolved inputs rather than inventing them.

00:00:52.868 --> 00:00:58.514
This lesson maps the process without creating payment or platform settings.
